34.139, "end": 134.319}, {"i": 295, "text": "you,", "start": 134.36, "end": 134.48}, {"i": 296, "text": "Doctor.", "start": 134.5, "end": 134.86}, {"i": 297, "text": "Goodbye.", "start": 135.26, "end": 135.64}], "segments": [{"start": 0.086, "end": 0.686, "text": "Good morning."}, {"start": 1.367, "end": 3.668, "text": "I am Dr. Winther, and you are?"}, {"start": 4.469, "end": 5.189, "text": "Gita Nagel."}, {"start": 5.65, "end": 6.15, "text": "Good morning."}, {"start": 7.171, "end": 7.651, "text": "Welcome."}, {"start": 8.432, "end": 11.614, "text": "Let us start with what has happened since your last appointment."}, {"start": 12.614, "end": 14.936, "text": "I attended the diabetes education course."}, {"start": 15.777, "end": 16.097, "text": "Good."}, {"start": 16.797, "end": 18.078, "text": "Tell me how you found it."}, {"start": 19.019, "end": 19.459, "text": "Thorough."}, {"start": 20.2, "end": 24.202, "text": "A lot of it I had already read, but hearing it explained properly helped."}, {"start": 25.243, "end": 26.804, "text": "That is often how it works."}, {"start": 27.705, "end": 29.586, "text": "May I ask what you took away from it?"}, {"start": 30.694, "end": 35.097, "text": "Mainly a clearer picture of the condition and why the treatment is what it is."}, {"start": 36.357, "end": 38.779, "text": "That is exactly the aim of the course."}, {"start": 39.999, "end": 41.48, "text": "So what are you assessing today?"}, {"start": 42.161, "end": 44.662, "text": "This feels more like a conversation than a check."}, {"start": 45.803, "end": 46.763, "text": "A fair question."}, {"start": 47.564, "end": 52.747, "text": "With type 2 diabetes, your own understanding of it is part of the treatment."}, {"start": 53.807, "end": 56.049, "text": "And you can judge that just from talking to me?"}, {"start": 57.089, "end": 58.31, "text": "To a degree, yes."}, {"start": 59.186, "end": 62.827, "text": "From what you describe, you seem engaged and motivated."}, {"start": 63.887, "end": 66.528, "text": "That is an impression, though, not a measurement."}, {"start": 67.769, "end": 69.409, "text": "It is an impression, yes."}, {"start": 70.349, "end": 75.431, "text": "My assessment is that you have a good understanding of your illness and your treatment."}, {"start": 76.531, "end": 76.971, "text": "All right."}, {"start": 77.471, "end": 78.292, "text": "I can accept that."}, {"start": 79.452, "end": 79.752, "text": "Good."}, {"start": 80.392, "end": 82.553, "text": "Then let me explain what happens next."}, {"start": 83.433, "end": 86.374, "text": "The plan is continued support and follow-up."}, {"start": 87.41, "end": 90.791, "text": "Why continued support if my understanding is already good?"}, {"start": 91.911, "end": 94.272, "text": "Because this is a long-term condition."}, {"start": 95.072, "end": 101.614, "text": "Support keeps that understanding useful over time, and follow-up lets us see how you are doing."}, {"start": 102.714, "end": 103.454, "text": "That makes sense."}, {"start": 104.695, "end": 107.175, "text": "Is anything about that plan unclear to you?"}, {"start": 108.416, "end": 109.856, "text": "No, that part is clear."}, {"start": 110.896, "end": 111.197, "text": "Good."}, {"start": 112.117, "end": 114.918, "text": "Are you managing to fit these appointments around work?"}, {"start": 115.998, "end": 116.438, "text": "Mostly."}, {"start": 117.074, "end": 119.515, "text": "I take the early slot and go in afterwards."}, {"start": 120.755, "end": 121.655, "text": "That works well."}, {"start": 122.376, "end": 123.216, "text": "Do you drive in?"}, {"start": 123.396, "end": 126.757, "text": "I cycle usually, though the bike is in for a service this week."}, {"start": 128.278, "end": 129.438, "text": "Then walking it is."}, {"start": 130.618, "end": 132.479, "text": "That is everything for today, Gitta."}, {"start": 132.899, "end": 133.479, "text": "Take care."}, {"start": 134.139, "end": 134.86, "text": "Thank you, Doctor."}, {"start": 135.26, "end": 135.64, "text": "Goodbye."}], "machine": "gpu59.int.triton.aalto.fi", "git_commit": "735eed3a1a4f5d8bc8a3ac1f1c8897e291443b9f", "date": "2026-09-20", "timing_s": {"transcribe_and_align": 2.287}}